    "name": "Transit Locations Trip Planning API",
    "description": "The Transit API delivers real-time public transit data - nearby routes and stops, stop departures, route details, multimodal trip planning, and service alerts - across 1,100+ cities in 37 countries, plus shared-mobility availability for bikes, scooters, and carshare.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Transit Partnerships\n Email: partners@transit.app",
